OL,3,GNEWSABird flu confirmed at commercial
OL,4,Apoultry farm
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn exclusion zone has been introduced
OL,7,Fat a commercial poultry farm in
OL,8,FHerefordshire after a case of bird flu
OL,9,Fwas confirmed.
OL,11,FIt comes after the highly pathogenic
OL,12,Favian influenza (H5N1) was identified
OL,13,Fat a site near Leominster, the
OL,14,FDepartment for Environment, Food and
OL,15,FRural Affairs (Defra).
OL,17,FA 3km (1.8 mile) protection zone and a
OL,18,Fwider 10km (6.2 mile) surveillance zone
OL,19,Fare in place around the site to help
OL,20,Fprevent the disease spreading, with
OL,21,FDefra confirming all affected birds
OL,22,Fwould be humanely culled.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
