OL,3,GNEWSABird flu confirmed at commercial
OL,4,Apoultry farm
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe restrictions came into force on
OL,7,FWednesday, with those keeping poultry
OL,8,For other captive birds within the
OL,9,Faffected areas required to follow
OL,10,Fstrict biosecurity measures and
OL,11,Fmovement restrictions.
